{"id": "transbay-plumbing-bid-challenge", "title": "A bidder invoked a union fabrication rule to challenge Transbay’s plumbing award", "seconds": 40.9, "voice": "elevenlabs:9PVP7ENhDskL0KYHAKtD", "narrator": "Jerry B.", "made": "2026-11-27", "key": "7a54c9d292100f7a", "words": 123, "beats": [{"scene": "r", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "A project labor agreement set rules for San Francisco’s transit center.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 3.7, "shot": "s0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["Who", "challenged", "the", "bid?"], "sub": "Transbay Transit Center plumbing"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.53, 0.83, 1.27, 1.52, 1.8, 1.94, 2.14, 2.74, 3.15]}, {"scene": "r", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "A side letter addressed pipe fabrication performed away from the site.", "t0": 3.82, "t1": 7.2, "shot": "s1", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "tjpa-2011-authority", "kicker": "Local 38 side letter", "text": "Off-site fabrication", "mark": "fabrication"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.47, 0.74, 1.12, 1.37, 2.06, 2.51, 2.78, 2.95, 3.05]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Five plumbing bidders had already qualified, including Airco and Desert.", "t0": 7.42, "t1": 10.99, "shot": "s2", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "5 firms", "label": "Prequalified plumbing bidders"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.3, 0.62, 0.92, 1.05, 1.36, 2.15, 2.68, 3.04, 3.16]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Airco ranked third and challenged both of the lower bids.", "t0": 11.11, "t1": 13.66, "shot": "s3", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "tjpa-plumbing-report", "kicker": "Staff report", "text": "Third lowest bidder", "mark": "Third"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.42, 0.69, 1.0, 1.13, 1.51, 1.73, 1.81, 1.92, 2.2]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Desert confirmed its price and exceeded the small-business goal.", "t0": 13.78, "t1": 16.75, "shot": "s4", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "14.8%", "label": "Small-business participation"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.35, 0.8, 0.96, 1.29, 1.42, 1.85, 1.98, 2.66]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "At the hearing, Airco’s lawyer invoked the union fabrication rule.", "t0": 16.87, "t1": 20.42, "shot": "s5", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "tjpa-testimony", "kicker": "Airco on Local 38", "text": "Fabrication work", "mark": "Fabrication"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.3, 0.94, 1.43, 1.76, 2.12, 2.28, 2.58, 3.25]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "He argued that Desert would need a subcontractor it had never listed.", "t0": 20.54, "t1": 23.77, "shot": "s6", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "tjpa-testimony", "kicker": "Airco counsel’s argument", "text": "Subcontractor listing requirement", "mark": "listing"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.48, 0.64, 0.95, 1.11, 1.3, 1.38, 2.26, 2.35, 2.5, 2.78]}, {"scene": "v", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "Four directors approved Desert for both plumbing and ventilation work.", "t0": 23.99, "t1": 27.07, "shot": "s7", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "4 in favor", "label": "1 abstention on each award"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.23, 0.69, 1.08, 1.4, 1.54, 1.77, 2.14, 2.27, 2.85]}, {"scene": "v", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "They also restored eighty thousand dollars for a greywater feature.", "t0": 27.19, "t1": 30.2, "shot": "s8", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$80,000", "label": "Restored to plumbing award"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.46, 0.89, 1.13, 1.51, 1.85, 2.03, 2.11, 2.61]}, {"scene": "v", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "Months later, Local 38 reported talking with Desert’s superintendent.", "t0": 30.32, "t1": 34.05, "shot": "s9", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "tjpa-pla-performance", "kicker": "Local 38 report", "text": "Desert Mechanical", "mark": "Desert"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.32, 0.84, 1.19, 1.7, 2.12, 2.48, 2.64, 3.0]}, {"scene": "v", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "They discussed how many apprentices and experienced workers the job would need.", "t0": 34.17, "t1": 37.75, "shot": "s10", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "tjpa-pla-performance", "kicker": "Workforce planning", "text": "Upcoming demand", "mark": "demand"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.65, 0.8, 1.02, 1.63, 1.77, 2.37, 2.76, 2.89, 3.14, 3.32]}, {"scene": "v", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 37.87, "t1": 39.98, "shot": "end", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.32, 0.63, 0.79, 1.03, 1.11, 1.21, 1.47, 1.75]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"r": "The fabrication agreement", "b": "The bid challenge", "v": "The vote and the work"}, "look": "dossier", "hook": "timeline"}